1
00:00:02,258 --> 00:00:04,427
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:06,304
Earth.

3
00:00:06,596 --> 00:00:08,598
Fire.

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,308
Air.

5
00:00:11,142 --> 00:00:15,104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,438 --> 00:00:19,275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,776 --> 00:00:22,403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,529 --> 00:00:23,738
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:26,699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

10
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:29,494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

11
00:00:29,577 --> 00:00:32,664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:35,166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

13
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:37,585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,710 --> 00:00:38,920
AANG: Oof!

15
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:42,006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:01:02,361 --> 00:01:04,613
More ferocious!

17
00:01:04,738 --> 00:01:06,365
Imagine striking through
your opponent's heart.

18
00:01:07,866 --> 00:01:09,743
( GROANS ) I'm trying.

19
00:01:09,868 --> 00:01:12,537
Now, let me hear you roar
like a tiger-dillo!

20
00:01:12,621 --> 00:01:14,373
( ROARS WEAKLY )

21
00:01:14,665 --> 00:01:16,416
That sounded pathetic.

22
00:01:16,792 --> 00:01:18,126
I said, roar!

23
00:01:19,086 --> 00:01:22,089
( ROARING )

24
00:01:22,422 --> 00:01:24,675
( CHATTERING )

25
00:01:25,884 --> 00:01:29,304
Who wants a nice cool
glass of watermelon juice?

26
00:01:29,429 --> 00:01:31,056
Ooh, ooh, me, me, me!

27
00:01:31,181 --> 00:01:34,685
Hey, your lesson's not over yet!
Get back here!

28
00:01:34,810 --> 00:01:36,812
Come on, Zuko, just take a break.

29
00:01:36,895 --> 00:01:38,105
What's the big deal?

30
00:01:38,522 --> 00:01:40,065
Fine.

31
00:01:40,816 --> 00:01:42,442
If you wanna lounge around

32
00:01:42,567 --> 00:01:44,653
like a bunch of snail sloths
all day, then go ahead!

33
00:01:44,778 --> 00:01:46,989
- AANG: ( SLURPING )
- Maybe Zuko's right.

34
00:01:47,072 --> 00:01:49,199
Sitting around the house
has made us pretty lazy.

35
00:01:49,449 --> 00:01:51,535
But I know just the thing to change that―

36
00:01:51,827 --> 00:01:53,662
Beach party!

37
00:02:13,890 --> 00:02:15,392
Check out my Appa sand-sculpture.

38
00:02:15,517 --> 00:02:16,727
( BELLOWS )

39
00:02:16,852 --> 00:02:18,854
Not, bad baldy.

40
00:02:18,979 --> 00:02:21,106
But I've been working on my sandbending.

41
00:02:21,231 --> 00:02:22,524
You're gonna love this.

42
00:02:28,071 --> 00:02:29,865
Whoa!

43
00:02:29,990 --> 00:02:33,035
Wow, you even made a little
Earth King and Bosco.

44
00:02:35,537 --> 00:02:37,247
Try and top that, Sokka.

45
00:02:38,957 --> 00:02:40,292
Ta-da!

46
00:02:40,417 --> 00:02:43,670
AANG: Is that a blubbering blob-monster?

47
00:02:43,795 --> 00:02:45,297
No, it's Suki!

48
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:48,759
BOTH: ( LAUGHING )

49
00:02:49,092 --> 00:02:50,427
Suki, we'll all understand

50
00:02:50,552 --> 00:02:52,429
if you break with him up over this.

51
00:02:52,554 --> 00:02:54,514
I think it's sweet.

52
00:02:55,766 --> 00:02:57,225
But it doesn't even look like―

53
00:02:57,309 --> 00:02:58,477
( SCREAMS )

54
00:03:11,281 --> 00:03:12,657
What are you doing?

55
00:03:14,534 --> 00:03:16,745
Teaching you a lesson.

56
00:03:31,093 --> 00:03:32,594
What happened?

57
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:34,304
Zuko's gone crazy!

58
00:03:34,388 --> 00:03:36,890
I made a sand sculpture
of Suki and he destroyed it!

59
00:03:38,642 --> 00:03:40,519
Oh, and he's attacking Aang.

60
00:03:59,204 --> 00:04:01,706
Get a grip before I blast
you off this roof!

61
00:04:02,124 --> 00:04:03,667
Go ahead and do it.

62
00:04:36,616 --> 00:04:37,826
Enough!

63
00:04:41,538 --> 00:04:42,998
( WOOD SPLINTERING )

64
00:04:43,123 --> 00:04:44,875
ZUKO: ( GRUNTING )

65
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,334
( GROANS )

66
00:04:47,627 --> 00:04:49,629
What's wrong with you?
You could have hurt Aang.

67
00:04:49,713 --> 00:04:50,881
What's wrong with me?

68
00:04:51,173 --> 00:04:52,924
What's wrong with all of you?

69
00:04:53,049 --> 00:04:54,593
How can you sit around
having beach parties

70
00:04:54,676 --> 00:04:57,095
when Sozin's comet
is only three days away?

71
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:01,766
Why are you all looking
at me like I'm crazy?

72
00:05:01,892 --> 00:05:03,810
About Sozin's comet―

73
00:05:03,935 --> 00:05:05,854
I was actually gonna
wait to fight the Fire Lord

74
00:05:05,979 --> 00:05:07,397
until after it came.

75
00:05:07,481 --> 00:05:08,565
After?

76
00:05:08,690 --> 00:05:09,858
I'm not ready.

77
00:05:09,983 --> 00:05:12,194
I need more time to master firebending.

78
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:14,279
And, frankly, your earthbending

79
00:05:14,404 --> 00:05:15,572
could still use some work, too.

80
00:05:15,989 --> 00:05:18,366
So, you all knew Aang was gonna wait?

81
00:05:18,825 --> 00:05:21,578
Honestly, if Aang tries to
fight the Fire Lord right now,

82
00:05:21,703 --> 00:05:22,996
he's gonna lose.

83
00:05:23,121 --> 00:05:24,247
No offense.

84
00:05:24,372 --> 00:05:27,209
The whole point of fighting the Fire Lord
before the comet

85
00:05:27,334 --> 00:05:29,294
was to stop the Fire Nation
from winning the war.

86
00:05:29,419 --> 00:05:32,172
But they pretty much won the war
when they took Ba Sing Se.

87
00:05:32,339 --> 00:05:34,549
Things can't get any worse.

88
00:05:34,883 --> 00:05:37,093
You're wrong.

89
00:05:37,219 --> 00:05:39,721
It's about to get worse
than you can even imagine.

90
00:05:40,222 --> 00:05:42,015
The day before the eclipse,

91
00:05:42,098 --> 00:05:44,809
my father asked me to attend
an important war meeting.

92
00:05:44,935 --> 00:05:47,979
It was what I'd dreamed about
and wanted for so many years.

93
00:05:48,104 --> 00:05:49,856
My father had finally accepted me back.

94
00:05:53,777 --> 00:05:55,779
OZAI: Welcome, Prince Zuko.

95
00:05:55,904 --> 00:05:57,572
We waited for you.

96
00:06:05,163 --> 00:06:07,499
General Shinu, your report.

97
00:06:07,832 --> 00:06:09,668
Thank you, sir.

98
00:06:09,751 --> 00:06:12,796
Ba Sing Se is still under our control,

99
00:06:12,921 --> 00:06:15,715
however, earthbender
rebellions have prevented us

100
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,843
from achieving total victory
in the Earth Kingdom.

101
00:06:18,927 --> 00:06:20,679
What is your recommendation?

102
00:06:20,845 --> 00:06:22,764
Our army is spread too thin,

103
00:06:22,889 --> 00:06:25,850
but once the eclipse is over,
and the invasion defeated,

104
00:06:25,976 --> 00:06:29,688
we should transfer more domestic
forces into the Earth Kingdom.

105
00:06:29,813 --> 00:06:31,273
Mmm...

106
00:06:31,356 --> 00:06:34,568
Prince Zuko, you've been among
the Earth Kingdom commoners.

107
00:06:34,901 --> 00:06:36,861
Do you think that adding more troops

108
00:06:36,945 --> 00:06:38,363
will stop these rebellions?

109
00:06:40,615 --> 00:06:43,827
The people of the Earth Kingdom
are proud and strong.

110
00:06:43,952 --> 00:06:47,789
They can endure anything
as long as they have hope.

111
00:06:47,914 --> 00:06:49,374
Yes, you're right.

112
00:06:51,042 --> 00:06:53,795
We need to destroy their hope.

113
00:06:54,296 --> 00:06:56,214
Well, that's not exactly what I―

114
00:06:56,339 --> 00:06:58,466
I think you should take
their precious hope,

115
00:06:58,592 --> 00:07:02,679
and the rest of their land
and burn it all to the ground.

116
00:07:02,804 --> 00:07:06,683
Yes, yes, you're right Azula.

117
00:07:06,808 --> 00:07:09,519
Sozin's comet is almost upon us,

118
00:07:09,603 --> 00:07:11,605
and on that day, it will endow us

119
00:07:11,730 --> 00:07:14,482
with the strength
and power of a hundred suns.

120
00:07:14,858 --> 00:07:17,235
No bender will stand a chance against us.

121
00:07:17,485 --> 00:07:19,696
What are you suggesting, sir?

122
00:07:20,030 --> 00:07:24,367
When the comet last came,
my grandfather, Fire Lord Sozin,

123
00:07:24,451 --> 00:07:26,578
used it to wipe out the Air Nomads.

124
00:07:26,786 --> 00:07:30,457
Now, I will use its power
to end the Earth Kingdom...

125
00:07:30,915 --> 00:07:32,375
Permanently!

126
00:07:33,752 --> 00:07:37,422
From our airships we will
rain fire over their lands,

127
00:07:37,547 --> 00:07:40,967
a fire that will destroy everything,

128
00:07:41,092 --> 00:07:44,638
and out of the ashes,
a new world will be born.

129
00:07:44,763 --> 00:07:47,641
A world in which all
the lands are Fire Nation,

130
00:07:47,724 --> 00:07:52,103
and I am the supreme ruler of everything!

131
00:07:52,312 --> 00:07:53,605
ALL: ( APPLAUDING )

132
00:07:53,688 --> 00:07:56,733
ZUKO: I wanted to speak out
against this horrifying plan,

133
00:07:56,816 --> 00:07:58,652
but I'm ashamed to say I didn't.

134
00:07:59,569 --> 00:08:00,695
My whole life, I've struggled

135
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:03,239
to gain my father's love and acceptance.

136
00:08:03,365 --> 00:08:04,783
But once I had it,

137
00:08:04,908 --> 00:08:07,744
I realized I'd lost myself getting there.

138
00:08:07,869 --> 00:08:10,413
I'd forgotten who I was.

139
00:08:10,538 --> 00:08:12,916
I can't believe this.

140
00:08:13,041 --> 00:08:15,418
I always knew the Fire Lord was a bad guy.

141
00:08:15,543 --> 00:08:18,755
But his plan is just pure evil.

142
00:08:19,089 --> 00:08:20,882
What am I gonna do?

143
00:08:21,007 --> 00:08:22,759
I know you're scared.

144
00:08:22,884 --> 00:08:25,220
And I know you're not
ready to save the world.

145
00:08:25,512 --> 00:08:28,598
But if you don't defeat the
Fire Lord before the comet comes,

146
00:08:28,682 --> 00:08:30,809
there won't be a world to save anymore.

147
00:08:37,857 --> 00:08:40,735
Why didn't you tell me about
your dad's crazy plan sooner?

148
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:42,404
I didn't think I had to.

149
00:08:42,529 --> 00:08:44,614
I assumed you were still gonna
fight him before the comet.

150
00:08:44,739 --> 00:08:47,200
No one told me you decided to wait.

151
00:08:47,325 --> 00:08:48,660
This is bad.

152
00:08:48,785 --> 00:08:51,162
This is really, really bad.

153
00:08:51,287 --> 00:08:54,374
Aang, you don't have to do this alone.

154
00:08:54,499 --> 00:08:56,960
Yeah, if we all fight
the Fire Lord together,

155
00:08:57,085 --> 00:08:58,753
we've got a shot at taking him down.

156
00:08:59,003 --> 00:09:01,506
All right! Team Avatar is back!

157
00:09:01,631 --> 00:09:02,757
Air.

158
00:09:02,882 --> 00:09:04,008
Water.

159
00:09:04,092 --> 00:09:05,093
Earth.

160
00:09:05,176 --> 00:09:06,177
Fire.

161
00:09:06,511 --> 00:09:08,430
Fan and sword.

162
00:09:09,723 --> 00:09:11,266
Fighting the Fire Lord

163
00:09:11,391 --> 00:09:13,435
is gonna be the hardest thing
we've ever done together.

164
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:15,812
But I wouldn't wanna do it any other way.

165
00:09:15,937 --> 00:09:17,647
ALL EXCEPT ZUKO: ( LAUGHING )

166
00:09:17,772 --> 00:09:19,774
- Yeah.
- All right.

167
00:09:19,899 --> 00:09:21,443
Get over here, Zuko.

168
00:09:21,568 --> 00:09:25,113
Being part of the group
also means being part of group hugs.

169
00:09:28,992 --> 00:09:30,577
( BELLOWING )

170
00:09:30,702 --> 00:09:31,995
( THUDS )

171
00:09:33,830 --> 00:09:35,123
ZUKO: There is one technique
you need to know

172
00:09:35,206 --> 00:09:36,666
before facing my father...

173
00:09:37,375 --> 00:09:38,960
How to redirect lightning.

174
00:09:40,420 --> 00:09:42,839
If you let the energy
in your own body flow,

175
00:09:42,964 --> 00:09:44,382
the lightning will follow it.

176
00:09:44,507 --> 00:09:46,926
You turn your opponents'
energy against them.

177
00:09:47,177 --> 00:09:49,471
- That's like waterbending.
- Exactly.

178
00:09:49,596 --> 00:09:51,556
My uncle invented this technique himself

179
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:52,807
by studying waterbenders.

180
00:09:53,266 --> 00:09:56,436
So, have you ever
redirected lightning before?

181
00:09:56,561 --> 00:09:57,687
Once...

182
00:09:57,812 --> 00:09:59,022
Against my father.

183
00:09:59,147 --> 00:10:00,398
What did it feel like?

184
00:10:01,191 --> 00:10:02,192
Exhilarating.

185
00:10:02,317 --> 00:10:05,069
( ELECTRICITY ZAPPING )

186
00:10:05,153 --> 00:10:06,404
But terrifying.

187
00:10:06,905 --> 00:10:08,239
( EXPLOSION )

188
00:10:09,657 --> 00:10:12,869
You feel so powerful holding
that much energy in your body,

189
00:10:12,994 --> 00:10:16,372
but you know if you make
the wrong move... It's over.

190
00:10:16,498 --> 00:10:19,626
( LAUGHS ) Well, not over-over.

191
00:10:19,751 --> 00:10:21,419
I mean, there is always Katara

192
00:10:21,544 --> 00:10:24,047
and a little spirit water action,
am I right?

193
00:10:24,339 --> 00:10:27,300
Actually, I used it all up
after Azula shot you.

194
00:10:27,842 --> 00:10:28,885
Oh.

195
00:10:29,052 --> 00:10:32,806
You'll have to take Fire Lord's
life before he takes yours.

196
00:10:34,349 --> 00:10:36,851
Yeah, I'll just do that.

197
00:10:43,024 --> 00:10:44,859
SOKKA: Gather around, Team Avatar.

198
00:10:47,028 --> 00:10:48,738
In order to take out the Fire Lord,

199
00:10:48,863 --> 00:10:50,573
or, in this case, the Melon Lord,

200
00:10:50,698 --> 00:10:52,784
our timing has to be perfect.

201
00:10:52,909 --> 00:10:55,286
First, Suki and I will draw his fire.

202
00:10:55,411 --> 00:10:58,998
Then Katara and Zuko charge in
with some liquidy hot offense,

203
00:10:59,123 --> 00:11:01,000
and while the Melon Lord is distracted,

204
00:11:01,125 --> 00:11:05,213
Aang swoops in and... Bam!
He delivers the final blow.

205
00:11:05,338 --> 00:11:07,382
Uh, what about me?

206
00:11:07,507 --> 00:11:09,384
For now, you're the Melon Lord's forces.

207
00:11:09,509 --> 00:11:12,053
So, I get to chuck
flaming rocks at all of you?

208
00:11:12,178 --> 00:11:14,305
Whatever makes the training
feel more realistic.

209
00:11:15,223 --> 00:11:16,474
Sweetness.

210
00:11:17,267 --> 00:11:19,727
Mwa-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

211
00:11:33,241 --> 00:11:34,659
( RUMBLING )

212
00:11:43,543 --> 00:11:46,379
( FLAMES CRACKLING )

213
00:11:46,504 --> 00:11:47,881
Watch it, Toph!

214
00:11:48,006 --> 00:11:51,342
I am not Toph, I am Melon Lord!

215
00:11:51,467 --> 00:11:53,511
Mwa-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

216
00:12:07,692 --> 00:12:08,693
Now, Aang!

217
00:12:19,829 --> 00:12:21,956
What are you waiting for? Take him out!

218
00:12:22,081 --> 00:12:23,416
I can't.

219
00:12:26,127 --> 00:12:27,503
What's wrong with you?

220
00:12:27,629 --> 00:12:29,172
If this was the real deal,

221
00:12:29,255 --> 00:12:31,090
you'd be shot full of lightning right now.

222
00:12:31,215 --> 00:12:33,551
I'm sorry, but it just didn't feel right.

223
00:12:34,302 --> 00:12:35,720
I didn't feel like myself.

224
00:12:38,473 --> 00:12:39,557
( WATERMELON SPLATTERS )

225
00:12:39,682 --> 00:12:41,517
There! That's how it's done.

226
00:12:42,936 --> 00:12:44,437
( NIBBLING )

227
00:12:54,948 --> 00:12:56,908
I have a surprise for everyone!

228
00:12:57,283 --> 00:13:00,119
I knew it! You did have
a secret thing with Haru!

229
00:13:02,455 --> 00:13:04,332
Uh... No.

230
00:13:04,457 --> 00:13:08,002
I was looking for cooking pots
in the attic and I found this.

231
00:13:09,462 --> 00:13:12,382
Look at baby Zuko! Isn't he cute?

232
00:13:12,507 --> 00:13:15,551
ALL EXCEPT ZUKO: ( LAUGHING )

233
00:13:15,677 --> 00:13:17,553
Oh, lighten up. I'm just teasing.

234
00:13:18,054 --> 00:13:21,099
That's not me. It's my father.

235
00:13:22,725 --> 00:13:24,811
But he looks so sweet and innocent.

236
00:13:24,936 --> 00:13:27,689
Well, that sweet little kid
grew up to be a monster.

237
00:13:27,814 --> 00:13:30,149
And the worst father
in the history of fathers.

238
00:13:30,274 --> 00:13:32,610
AANG: But he's still a human being.

239
00:13:33,069 --> 00:13:34,612
You're going to defend him?

240
00:13:34,696 --> 00:13:36,447
No, I agree with you.

241
00:13:36,572 --> 00:13:38,574
Fire Lord Ozai is a horrible person,

242
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:40,743
and the world will probably
be better off without him,

243
00:13:40,868 --> 00:13:42,578
but there's gotta be another way.

244
00:13:42,704 --> 00:13:43,997
ZUKO: Like what?

245
00:13:44,122 --> 00:13:45,289
I don't know.

246
00:13:45,456 --> 00:13:47,792
Maybe we can make some big pots of glue

247
00:13:47,875 --> 00:13:49,127
and then I can use gluebending

248
00:13:49,252 --> 00:13:50,545
to stick his arms and legs together

249
00:13:50,670 --> 00:13:52,130
so he can't bend anymore.

250
00:13:52,505 --> 00:13:54,173
Yeah, then you can show
him his baby pictures

251
00:13:54,298 --> 00:13:56,300
and all those happy memories
will make him good again.

252
00:13:56,426 --> 00:13:58,052
Do you really think that would work?

253
00:13:58,428 --> 00:14:00,263
- No!
-( SIGHS HEAVILY )

254
00:14:01,973 --> 00:14:04,809
This goes against everything
I learned from the monks.

255
00:14:04,934 --> 00:14:07,645
I can't just go around
wiping out people I don't like.

256
00:14:07,770 --> 00:14:10,064
Sure, you can. You're the Avatar.

257
00:14:10,189 --> 00:14:11,733
If it's in the name of keeping balance,

258
00:14:11,858 --> 00:14:14,152
I'm pretty sure the universe
will forgive you.

259
00:14:14,569 --> 00:14:16,529
This isn't a joke, Sokka!

260
00:14:16,654 --> 00:14:18,906
None of you understand
the position I'm in!

261
00:14:19,032 --> 00:14:21,284
Aang, we do understand. It's just―

262
00:14:21,367 --> 00:14:23,077
Just what, Katara, what?

263
00:14:23,161 --> 00:14:24,954
We're trying to help.

264
00:14:25,079 --> 00:14:27,290
When you figure out a way
for me to beat the Fire Lord

265
00:14:27,415 --> 00:14:29,917
without taking his life,
I'd love to hear it!

266
00:14:31,544 --> 00:14:33,796
Aang, don't walk away from this.

267
00:14:35,006 --> 00:14:37,425
Let him go.

268
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:40,011
He needs time to sort it out by himself.

269
00:14:55,401 --> 00:14:57,153
( CHATTERING )

270
00:14:57,278 --> 00:14:58,613
Hey, Momo.

271
00:14:58,738 --> 00:15:00,823
I don't suppose you know what I should do.

272
00:15:01,199 --> 00:15:02,450
( SQUAWKS )

273
00:15:02,575 --> 00:15:03,868
I didn't think so.

274
00:15:18,508 --> 00:15:21,719
MEN: ( DEEP-TONED HYPNOTIC CHANTING )

275
00:15:37,026 --> 00:15:39,362
( HYPNOTIC CHANT CONTINUES )

276
00:16:03,845 --> 00:16:05,054
SOKKA: Okay, that's everything.

277
00:16:05,179 --> 00:16:07,807
No, it's not. Where's Aang?

278
00:16:12,353 --> 00:16:14,897
Aang? Aang?

279
00:16:15,022 --> 00:16:16,899
Come on, lazy bones, let's go!

280
00:16:18,776 --> 00:16:20,153
( DOOR CREAKS, THUDS )

281
00:16:30,830 --> 00:16:32,415
He left his staff.

282
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:33,708
That's so strange.

283
00:16:33,833 --> 00:16:35,877
Aang's not in a house.
Let's check the beach.

284
00:16:39,005 --> 00:16:41,465
SOKKA: Look! There's his footprints.

285
00:16:41,591 --> 00:16:43,092
The trail ends here.

286
00:16:43,551 --> 00:16:46,721
So, he went for a midnight
swim and never came back?

287
00:16:46,846 --> 00:16:48,347
Maybe he was captured.

288
00:16:48,472 --> 00:16:50,808
I don't think so.
There's no sign of a struggle.

289
00:16:50,933 --> 00:16:52,602
I bet he ran away again.

290
00:16:52,727 --> 00:16:55,313
Uh-uh. He left behind his glider and Appa.

291
00:16:55,438 --> 00:16:56,898
Then what do you think

292
00:16:57,023 --> 00:16:58,482
happened to him, oh, sleuthy one?

293
00:16:59,192 --> 00:17:01,068
It's pretty obvious.

294
00:17:01,194 --> 00:17:03,487
Aang mysteriously disappears
before an important battle?

295
00:17:03,779 --> 00:17:06,282
He's definitely on a Spirit World journey.

296
00:17:06,407 --> 00:17:09,160
But if he was,
wouldn't his body still be here?

297
00:17:09,285 --> 00:17:11,037
Oh, yeah, I forgot about that.

298
00:17:11,162 --> 00:17:13,039
KATARA: Then he's gotta be
somewhere on Ember Island.

299
00:17:13,164 --> 00:17:14,707
Let's split up and look for him.

300
00:17:14,957 --> 00:17:16,584
I'm going with Zuko!

301
00:17:16,667 --> 00:17:18,211
What?

302
00:17:18,336 --> 00:17:20,880
Everyone else went on
a life-changing field-trip with Zuko.

303
00:17:20,963 --> 00:17:22,173
Now, it's my turn.

304
00:17:30,181 --> 00:17:32,475
CROWD: ( CHANTING ) Aang! Aang!

305
00:17:36,062 --> 00:17:37,855
( CHANTING CONTINUES )

306
00:17:39,732 --> 00:17:42,318
- Avatar State, yip-yip!
- CROWD: ( CHEERING )

307
00:17:42,401 --> 00:17:44,153
BOTH: ( GROWLING )

308
00:17:44,445 --> 00:17:47,156
TOPH: And then when I was
nine, I ran away again.

309
00:17:47,281 --> 00:17:49,408
- Uh-huh.
- I know I shouldn't complain.

310
00:17:49,533 --> 00:17:52,036
My parents gave me
everything I ever asked for.

311
00:17:52,161 --> 00:17:55,081
But they never gave the one
thing that I really wanted...

312
00:17:55,206 --> 00:17:57,166
Their love, you know what I mean?

313
00:17:57,250 --> 00:17:58,542
( GROANS )

314
00:17:58,668 --> 00:18:00,795
Look, I know you had a rough childhood.

315
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:04,131
But we should really
focus on finding Aang.

316
00:18:04,674 --> 00:18:06,926
This is the worst field-trip ever.

317
00:18:07,051 --> 00:18:08,636
( BLOWS )

318
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:15,893
Judging by the looks on your faces,

319
00:18:16,018 --> 00:18:18,271
I'm guessing you guys
didn't find Aang, either.

320
00:18:19,563 --> 00:18:21,357
No.

321
00:18:21,482 --> 00:18:23,943
It's like he just disappeared.

322
00:18:24,068 --> 00:18:25,528
Hey, wait a minute.

323
00:18:25,653 --> 00:18:27,738
Has anyone noticed that
Momo is missing, too?

324
00:18:27,863 --> 00:18:31,867
Oh, no! I knew it
was only a matter of time!

325
00:18:32,868 --> 00:18:35,121
Appa ate Momo!

326
00:18:35,329 --> 00:18:37,707
Momo, I'm coming for you, buddy!

327
00:18:37,999 --> 00:18:41,585
Sokka, Appa didn't eat Momo.
He's probably with Aang.

328
00:18:42,086 --> 00:18:45,172
That's just what Appa wants you to think.

329
00:18:45,464 --> 00:18:47,466
ZUKO: Get out of the bison's mouth, Sokka.

330
00:18:47,591 --> 00:18:49,260
We have a real problem here.

331
00:18:49,385 --> 00:18:52,430
Aang is nowhere to be found and
the comet is only two days away.

332
00:18:52,555 --> 00:18:54,890
What should we do, Zuko?

333
00:18:55,391 --> 00:18:56,809
I don't know.

334
00:18:59,854 --> 00:19:01,480
Why are you all looking at me?

335
00:19:01,689 --> 00:19:04,442
Well, you are kind of
the expert on tracking Aang.

336
00:19:04,567 --> 00:19:08,612
Yeah, if anyone's got experience
hunting the Avatar, it's you.

337
00:19:13,451 --> 00:19:15,578
Zuko, I don't wanna tell
you how to do your job,

338
00:19:15,703 --> 00:19:17,747
but why we are heading
towards the Earth Kingdom?

339
00:19:18,164 --> 00:19:19,749
There's no way Aang's there.

340
00:19:19,874 --> 00:19:21,584
Just trust me.

341
00:19:41,145 --> 00:19:43,147
Come on, slowpokes, faster!

342
00:20:04,794 --> 00:20:06,379
Sorry I'm late, Father.

343
00:20:06,504 --> 00:20:10,091
Good palanquin bearers are
so hard to come by these days.

344
00:20:10,216 --> 00:20:12,760
So, is everything ready for our departure?

345
00:20:12,885 --> 00:20:15,096
There has been a change of plans, Azula.

346
00:20:15,221 --> 00:20:16,222
What?

347
00:20:16,305 --> 00:20:20,351
I've decided to lead the fleet
of airships to Ba Sing Se alone.

348
00:20:20,643 --> 00:20:23,771
You will remain here in the Fire Nation.

349
00:20:24,105 --> 00:20:26,690
But, I thought we were
going to do this together.

350
00:20:27,024 --> 00:20:29,443
My decision is final.

351
00:20:30,236 --> 00:20:32,780
You... You can't treat me like this!

352
00:20:32,905 --> 00:20:34,740
You can't treat me like Zuko!

353
00:20:34,865 --> 00:20:37,368
Azula, silence yourself.

354
00:20:37,493 --> 00:20:39,995
But it was my idea to burn
everything to the ground.

355
00:20:40,121 --> 00:20:41,914
I deserve to be by your side!

356
00:20:42,039 --> 00:20:44,750
Azula!

357
00:20:44,875 --> 00:20:46,127
Listen to me.

358
00:20:46,252 --> 00:20:49,130
I need you here
to watch over the homeland.

359
00:20:49,255 --> 00:20:53,801
It's a very important job that
I can only entrust to you.

360
00:20:53,926 --> 00:20:55,302
Really?

361
00:20:55,428 --> 00:20:57,555
And for your loyalty,

362
00:20:57,680 --> 00:21:01,350
I've decided to declare you
the new Fire Lord.

363
00:21:02,143 --> 00:21:04,186
Fire Lord Azula?

364
00:21:04,311 --> 00:21:06,981
It does seems appropriate.

365
00:21:07,106 --> 00:21:08,566
But, what about you?

366
00:21:08,858 --> 00:21:12,194
Fire Lord Ozai is no more.

367
00:21:12,319 --> 00:21:15,364
Just as the world will be reborn in fire,

368
00:21:15,489 --> 00:21:19,994
I shall be reborn
as the supreme ruler of the world.

369
00:21:20,119 --> 00:21:23,747
From this moment on, I will be known as...

370
00:21:23,873 --> 00:21:25,833
The Phoenix King!

371
00:21:38,012 --> 00:21:39,597
( FLAMES ROARING )

372
00:21:53,152 --> 00:21:55,654
TAVERN PATRONS: ( SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY )

373
00:21:57,907 --> 00:21:59,158
And the reason you brought us

374
00:21:59,283 --> 00:22:01,535
to a seedy Earth Kingdom tavern
is what now?

375
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:02,828
June.

376
00:22:04,830 --> 00:22:06,415
MAN: ( GROANS )

377
00:22:06,916 --> 00:22:08,709
SOKKA: Oh, yeah, that weird bounty hunter

378
00:22:08,834 --> 00:22:10,419
with the giant mole.

379
00:22:10,544 --> 00:22:12,505
KATARA: Mole? Her skin is flawless.

380
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:14,006
SOKKA: No, she has this
giant mole-creature

381
00:22:14,131 --> 00:22:15,591
she rides around on.

382
00:22:15,799 --> 00:22:16,967
The Shirshu.

383
00:22:17,092 --> 00:22:18,886
It's the only animal that
can track Aang's scent

384
00:22:19,011 --> 00:22:20,554
anywhere in the world.

385
00:22:20,679 --> 00:22:22,515
It's the one shot we have of finding him.

386
00:22:22,848 --> 00:22:24,517
MAN: ( GRUNTING )

387
00:22:35,319 --> 00:22:39,114
I don't know who this
June lady is, but I like her.

388
00:22:40,366 --> 00:22:43,410
MOMO: ( PURRING )

389
00:22:43,744 --> 00:22:46,080
( GROANS )

390
00:22:46,205 --> 00:22:49,458
Hey, Momo. I just had the strangest dream.

391
00:22:52,545 --> 00:22:54,630
Wait!

392
00:23:03,722 --> 00:23:05,182
AANG: Where are we?

393
00:23:14,333 --> 00:23:16,335
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
